WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.550
You have one message: the
school play needs more helpers.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.190
First, you tell your
best friend at lunch.

3
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.670
Then you tell your whole class.

4
00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.730
Then you tell the head teacher.

5
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.710
Do you say it the same
way all three times?

6
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.590
If the message stays the
same, what should change,

7
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.190
and what shouldn't?

8
00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.660
In this mission, you'll read
the room and adapt your tone.

9
00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.050
You'll rehearse and perform
scripts and poems for dramatic

10
00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:26.550
effect.

11
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.370
And you'll test four common
myths about speaking,

12
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.470
including one about nerves.

13
00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:36.410
Your mission: decide how to say
one message to three different

14
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:37.790
audiences.
